   "body": "**Capture result** (PR #435, run 10, 2026-11-02): `T01` (`rss.php`) and `T02` (`api/getAlertesByTopic.php?topic_id=`), plus the legacy oracle `Fixtures/LOT-028/T01.oracle.json` (kind `aq-rss`, `AQRSSParserDelegate` @ 2440d79).\n- The RSS is RSS 2.0 (`application/rss+xml`), 25 items, descriptions as CDATA HTML; topic titles there hold `&quot;`, `&#039;`, `&amp;` and legacy returns them **undecoded** as `topicTitle` (B4 / #105 confirmed), while the item `<title>` arrives decoded.\n- `getAlertesByTopic.php` answers **XML**, not JSON: `<alertes><alerte id nom pseudoInitiateur date=\"dd-mm-yyyy\" postsIds/>…`; legacy has no parser for it (only `content.contains(postID)`).\n- Changes: LOT-028 (#56) spec Fixtures section and HFR-PROTOCOL §7b B4 / §8 rows. Unblocks LOT-028 once merged.",
   "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
